    "scope": "Root personally viewed all4 native source images, nearest4 raw pixel enlargements, full returned PNGs, and white/cyan/alpha comparison page. Ordered builtin bindings verified: runtime/root-review-slot-b/rollingb175/verified-binding.json SHA256 08073e0e68585c6a969b8dd24543a713455525ccabd0c68e4c82aaa1717d618e. Prior actual mascot reference view reused by exact SHA 766ae05fcdab3bd41f9f0967e64f387de3adafef0f29626570d5670d9b460976. Review began 2026-10-26 21:18:46 UTC completed 2026-10-26 21:19:32 UTC. All four output alpha255/255 and opaque backing/clothing intact. Fine uncertain source stubble/insignia not invented or held solely for unreadability. A dark mouth interior or single shaded edge is not paired human lips; broad continuous lower head is not by itself a separate long neck. No game-display claim.",
    "approved": {
      "1": "Grey fur ushanka with red star, short visible dark side hair/brows, clean/unbearded source chin, left three-quarter gaze, grey double-lapel coat/red-edge tabs and diagonal brown straps, olive inner stand collar/two pale buttons retained. Yellow round mascot with slightly open simple mouth, dark interior allowed; broad short neck fit contacts collar, pale backing retained.",
      "2": "Khaki folded side cap with red star, dark short side hair/brows and greying moustache, clean chin, khaki high-collar two-button uniform and gold/red shoulders retained. Round yellow head and single small open mouth under moustache, no added human nose/ears; compact broad collar fit, pale backing opaque.",
      "3": "Short brushed dark hair and brows, frontal stern gaze, dark olive uniform with red/gold collar patches bearing three stars each and central gold button retained. Original tiny facial shadow does not establish a shaped beard. Yellow broad continuous lower head meets adapted collar without a separate narrow/long neck; simple single mouth opening and pale backing preserved.",
      "4": "Swept dark hair and thick brows, clean chin, left/up three-quarter gaze, very dark navy high gold-leaf collar, gold shoulders/buttons, two gold chest stars and central light hanging star preserved. Round yellow mascot, simple stern mouth with no fleshy lip pair, short broad fit directly into collar; opaque dark clothing and pale backing retained."
